  "id": "inaccessibility",
  "term": "inaccessibility",
  "definition": "In this context, inaccessibility means a psychological barrier to understanding or emotionally connecting with something even when it is plainly visible or available. It refers to difficulty grasping the implied feelings, meanings, or concepts because of differences in cultural and aesthetic frameworks.",
